<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Kelanamas stock suspended.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Kelanamas stock suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's Kelanamas Industries Bhd said it has suspended trading of its shares on the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange with effect from Friday afternoon.</p>
<p>The company said a statement to the KLSE that the suspension took effect from 1438 local time (0638GMT).</p>
<p>&quot;We shall shortly forward to the exchange our reasons for this request,&quot; Kelanamas said in its statement.</p>
<p>Kelanamas shares closed up 12 cents to 4.78 ringgit on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
